WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.200
You can do it properly.

00:02.200 --> 00:03.940
But they went back to where they were,

00:03.940 --> 00:07.180
and they opened up a lot of different plants,

00:07.180 --> 00:10.080
energy plants, energy-producing plants,

00:10.080 --> 00:11.140
and they're doing well.

00:11.140 --> 00:13.740
I give Germany a lot of credit for that.

00:13.740 --> 00:17.020
They've said this is a disaster what's happening.

00:17.020 --> 00:18.420
They were going all green.

00:18.420 --> 00:21.560
All green is all bankrupt.

00:21.560 --> 00:23.420
That's what it represents.

00:23.420 --> 00:25.660
And it's not politically correct.

00:25.660 --> 00:27.820
I'll be very badly criticized for saying it,

00:27.820 --> 00:29.800
but I'm here to tell the truth.

00:29.800 --> 00:32.140
I don't care. It doesn't matter to me.

00:32.140 --> 00:33.980
I'm in New York City.

00:33.980 --> 00:35.480
I'm feeling a lot safer.

00:35.480 --> 00:37.300
Crime, we're getting crime down.

00:37.300 --> 00:39.980
And by the way, speaking of crime, Washington, D.C.

00:39.980 --> 00:41.380
Washington, D.C.

